// A value set to the value the actor already has.

@channel pose
@channel effect: still, shake
@actor mira
    name: Mira
    pose: neutral, happy, sad

== kitchen.door
mira (happy): This line sets the pose.
mira (happy): The pose on this line changes nothing.
//    ^^^^^ PIB5016
mira (happy, shake): Only the shake is a change.
//    ^^^^^ PIB5016

// Must not trigger

== kitchen.cellar
mira (happy): This line sets the pose.
@call kitchen.door
mira (happy): After a call, the pose may have changed.
mira (sad): A different pose is a change.
mira (shake): Another channel is a change of its own.
-> Look around
    mira (sad): Inside an option, the pose isn't known.
